        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What pool fence height does Georgia require?",
            "answer": "<p>Georgia applies the 2018 International Swimming Pool and Spa Code with its state minimum codes, and section 305 sets a 48-inch barrier. Our 46-inch tempered panel installed in spigots gives a 48-inch railing, so that is the pool panel for Georgia. Add gate hinges and a latch for the opening, and ask your local building department about self-closing gate details before ordering.</p>",
            "pages": ""
          }
