          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will a coastal Georgia building department want engineering documents?",
            "answer": "<p>It may. Chatham County, Glynn County and the City of Savannah review deck and railing attachments. A plan reviewer can ask how the spigots are fixed. We provide engineering documents with testing results and blocking details for top-mount and side-mount spigots on concrete and on wood. Download them from our engineering page and include them with the permit application.</p>",
            "pages": ""
